Before writing or changing Effect / Layer / Schema / `@effect/sql*` code:

1. Read `node_modules/effect/AGENTS.md` (or the pnpm nested path under `.pnpm/effect@…`).
2. Prefer `node_modules/effect/src` and `@effect/sql-pg` over web search.
3. If `repos/effect/` exists, use it as read-only reference; never import from it.
4. Follow `.agent/skills/effect-ts/SKILL.md` and root `AGENTS.md`.
